    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2025/02/2202.md",
      "sha256": "5821ac609c2edc1009006cfc88b44549b313fdfcf28af36885b19138c4f289d7",
      "slug": "\"2202\"",
      "title": "\"某种意识以某种方式持续观察物质会得到某种确定的结果，即为「因果」。\""
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2025/02/2203.md",
      "sha256": "39b992d7af85820c38f9d137a3eab97d384bb3ea52888dfc214633ffc8b4fb29",
      "slug": "\"2202\"",
      "title": "\"微观上粒子层面的确定因果，宏观上物质层面的确定因果，即自然科学所研究的规律。\""
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2025/02/2202.en.md",
      "sha256": "a7b9fe26f3319d9859a82b3905f421bbf160fc62bdf761c8204ecd016ded53aa",
      "slug": "\"2202\"",
      "title": "\"When a certain consciousness observes matter in a certain way over time, a certain certainty arises—that is *‘karma’*.\""
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2025/02/2203.en.md",
      "sha256": "2b183e196fe78ae3e565448f002567add76250f4029e0078969eb87a5be2b334",
      "slug": "\"2202\"",
      "title": "\"Deterministic karma at the micro level of particles, deterministic karma at the macro level of matter—that is the law studied by natural science.\""
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2023/04/1401.md",
      "sha256": "9dfe48060bdff4f2412822fa6d2d1c889f95d82846fd949417870f80af2029bd",
      "slug": "\"1401\"",
      "title": "\"选择权。\""
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2023/04/1402.md",
      "sha256": "91159df121341dadf971b07cd26490df09f292ac2ab84dad869baf173b1abf93",
      "slug": "\"1401\"",
      "title": "\"有选择权才有发展权。\""
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2023/04/1401.en.md",
      "sha256": "1e5cd69f2fe60c568e07b6822a5d260449228aa5ad1f32370979de29bef7b776",
      "slug": "\"1401\"",
      "title": "\"Choice. Choice. And choice again.\""
    },
    {
      "source": "/Users/rong.zhu/Code/zhurong/zhurongshuo/content/posts/2023/04/1402.en.md",
      "sha256": "6578cb420c6494b3a373897f61a8941b144622b5362081ef82b6f62b42be1f93",
      "slug": "\"1401\"",
      "title": "\"Only with the right to choose can there be the right to develop.\""
    }
  ],
